Rule 7 (Check for zero values in x or y)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= x ≠ 0 ∧ y ≠ 0
>>
Rule 8 (Checking if tensors have at least one dimension)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ndim(x) > 0 ∧ ndim(y) > 0
>>
Rule 9 (x and y should have same shape)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= shape(x) = shape(y)
>>
Rule 19 (Ensure that x and y have the same number of dimensions)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ndim(x) = ndim(y)
>>
Rule 27 (The dimensions of the tensors must be positive)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) > 0
>>
Rule 29 (x and y have the same dtype, using dtype_ function)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= dtype_(x) = dtype_(y)
>>
Rule 38 (The dimensions of x and y must be greater than or equal to zero.)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 39 (If x is a scalar, y must be a scalar)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (ndim(x) = 0 ∧ ndim(y) = 0) ∨ (ndim(x) > 0 ∧ ndim(y) > 0)
